SKIN Requiem: Black knee-length long SLEEVED leather coat, studded shoulders, black shirt, cargo trousers. Keep long coat silhouette and sleeves; no Rock vest.
FORM Normal: Brown wavy hair, black clothes, silver hardware. No transformed crystal trim. DIM DARK CARMINE ember aura (#8A1028), less saturated and less intense than bright scarlet Ruptura.
CAMERA N: NORTH/straight BACK, back of hair/coat/vest, back of gauntlets/greaves. NO visible face/eyes/frontal shirt. Attack travels AWAY/up-screen.
Use approved young compact large-head proportions; identical head size across poses. Body can crouch/jump without scale shrinking. Preserve asymmetry of belt-chain and clothes. Paired dark steel curved fang-ridged gauntlets from fists to forearms and greaves from shins to toes. No hand-held blade, scythe or chain. Only decorative hip chain remains.
